{
  "version": "1.1",
  "method": "Existing v1 patterns retain priority. Only when none match, count matching refinement rules by category; highest count wins, taxonomy order breaks ties. Rules inspect change idea text only; Other for no support. Confidence is qualitative evidence strength, not a probability.",
